{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"f8d0bcf337485386bda4ecc7eeb62bb39edcfb709bf862dc3526385c805e902f","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"e68cd1e92d8d4ed30000ea6f99cf98644f5bbccf68cc81a9817a93fd369ba8b9","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"源码第71–76行表明被击退者移动若干格后与 nextTarget 发生碰撞；“被推送%d格进入#Target#”把碰撞关系表述成进入目标体内，关系语义失真。"},{"revision_key":"e6976768f97b261a317d34b20fbdd66a6f42788687a1c448ec78f729eb5b8bd7","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"该日志由 mindCrit 的暴击分支触发，而固定源码 call.lua 第134–137行将 mindCrit 用于 target:heal；因此它也可描述治疗暴击，“精神攻击造成了致命一击”错误限定为攻击并误述效果。"}]}